<title>GERMANY: ALPINE SKIING-COMPAGNONI WINS GIANT SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-COMPAGNONI WINS GIANT SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>ZWIESEL, Germany 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Deborah Compagnoni won the fourth women's World Cup giant slalom of the Alpine skiing season on Friday when she clocked an aggregate two minutes 8.45 seconds for the two runs, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Austria's Anita Wachter was second in 2:09.61 with Sweden's Pernilla Wiberg third in 2:09.92.</p>
